  "name": "District 4 \u2014 Kh\u00e1nh H\u1ed9i peninsula",
  "area_km2": 4.459,
  "published_area_km2": 4.18,
  "note": "The land between the Ben Nghe and Te canals and the Saigon River. Ring built from the two canal centrelines (OSM ways 289925742 and 289925740, read 2026-09-04) joined west at their shared junction and closed east across the river frontage between their mouths. Centrelines put half of each canal's width inside the ring, which is most of the 7% excess over the published 4.18 km2. District 4 ceased to exist administratively in Vietnam's 2025 ward merger; the peninsula is the stable definition, and is what the historical sheets show.",
